        "original_id": "8a533c54-1919-50f1-bf4e-1b1b4a825447",
        "text": "Page: No Surprises. Sentence: \"No Surprises\" is a song by the English alternative rock band Radiohead, released as the third and final single from their third studio album \"OK Computer\" (1997) on 12 January 1998.\nPage: OK Computer. Sentence: Other than the song \"Lucky\", which was recorded in 1995, Radiohead recorded the album in Oxfordshire and Bath between 1996 and early 1997, mostly in the historic mansion St Catherine's Court.\nPage: Radiodread. Sentence: Radiodread is a 2006 tribute album by the Easy Star All-Stars that covers Radiohead's 1997 album \"OK Computer\" in reggae, ska and dub styles.",
